{"path": "notebook/papers/gmpo.md", "updated": "2026-10-21T01:08:53+08:00", "url": "https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/ee80783414e46bd05f1fae83f70250c4615d99ea/notebook/papers/gmpo.md", "html": "<h1 id=\"gmpo\">GMPO：完整裁剪目标、符号分支与旧结论更正</h1>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2507.20673v1\">论文 v1 Eq.4 / Algorithm 1</a>；<a href=\"https://github.com/callsys/GMPO/blob/ae9cbebd8cc6b58a6db6c61cb90e4b13ff131d94/train_zero_math_gmpo.py#L675\">作者代码固定提交</a>；<a href=\"https://github.com/verl-project/verl/blob/1876b06d0a3e4e71e06230be10af14492ca8a75b/verl/trainer/ppo/core_algos.py#L1928\">verl 报告版本</a>。2026-10-21 重审。关联：<a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/ee80783414e46bd05f1fae83f70250c4615d99ea/notebook/rl-policy-loss-functions-mathematical-derivation.md\">损失综述</a>、<a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/ee80783414e46bd05f1fae83f70250c4615d99ea/notebook/papers/gspo.md\">GSPO 更正</a>。</p>\n<p><strong>结论</strong>：论文 Algorithm 1 本身在 log 空间裁剪，默认 epsilon=0.4 对应 exp(±0.4)，不是 1±0.4。“论文与 verl 配置空间不一致”的旧判断撤回。原脚本只比较双侧 clamp、缺优势符号与最终目标，不能支持完整等价；当前只在明确条件下建立代数对应和有限数值验证。<a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/ee80783414e46bd05f1fae83f70250c4615d99ea/open-source/verl/verl-clip-semantics-rfc-draft.md\">旧 RFC</a>不再独立推进，没有新上游缺陷或训练根因结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">从完整目标推导</h2>\n<p>设有效 token 对数比率 <span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><msub><mi>π</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z=\\log\\pi_{\\mathrm{new}}-\\log\\pi_{\\mathrm{old}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">new</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">old</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、同一响应恒定优势 A、<span class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sign</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s=\\operatorname{sign}(A)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">sign</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，有效 token 数 N&gt;0。以下均是要最小化的负收益，不含辅助损失。</p>\n<p>论文 Eq.4 先对 <strong>r^s</strong> 做 min/clip，再取 s 次幂与几何均值。写成 log 形式：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mtable rowspacing=\"0.25em\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">clamp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>L</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">mean</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msub><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\phi_{\\mathrm{paper}}(z,s)&amp;=s\\min\\bigl(sz,\\operatorname{clamp}(sz,\\log L,\\log U)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\ell&amp;=-A\\exp\\bigl(\\operatorname{mean}_{\\mathrm{valid}}\\phi_{\\mathrm{paper}}\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:2.72em;vertical-align:-1.11em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-r\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.61em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.76em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">paper</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.11em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.61em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.76em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">sz</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">clamp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">sz</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">mean</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">valid</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">paper</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.11em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>这里 L/U 是 signed ratio 的阈值。Algorithm 1 取 log L=−ε、log U=ε；作者代码用相反 sign 与 max，标量优势、对称窗口下是同一代数形式。只读过该分支，未运行作者训练程序，也未验证其 batch 约束。</p>\n<p>verl 指定版本的次序不同：先 clamp <strong>原始 z</strong>，再乘优势 sign、取 min、乘回 sign：</p>\n<div class=\"arithmatex\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ϕ</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">clamp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>z</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\n\\phi_{\\mathrm{verl}}(z,s)=s\\min\\bigl(sz,s\\operatorname{clamp}(z,-a,b)\\bigr).\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϕ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"katex-sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">verl</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"katex-base\"><span class=\"katex-strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">sz</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">clamp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span><span class=\"mord\">.</span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<p>它化简为：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>phi_verl</th>\n<th>哪一侧被截平</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>A&gt;0</td>\n<td>min(z,b)</td>\n<td>z&gt;b；相反的低比率尾部仍有梯度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>A&lt;0</td>\n<td>max(z,−a)</td>\n<td>z&lt;−a；相反的高比率尾部仍有梯度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>A=0</td>\n<td>孤立 PG loss 为 0</td>\n<td>不推论辅助项也为零</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>因此不能把双侧 clamp 本身当完整 PG 目标，也不能说所有窗口外 token 均被裁平。各有效 token 的内部导数在未裁平侧为 loss/N，在裁平侧为 0（这里对 z 求导，非模型参数/优化器或 clip 拐点）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_2\">什么条件下对应</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>对称窗口 a=b=ε</strong>：Eq.4 取 L=exp(−ε)、U=exp(ε)，Algorithm 1 与 verl 的理想化非空响应目标相同。未裁剪时，序列几何均值给响应内 token 共享权重；不是未归一全序列乘积。</li>\n<li><strong>一般原始 ratio 窗口</strong>：常规 PPO <code>min(A*r, A*clip(r, exp(-a), exp(b)))</code> 取绝对值后的几何均值再恢复 A 的符号，与上述 verl 理想模型对应。正负优势均须包含；旧笔记漏写了负优势分支。</li>\n<li><strong>Eq.4 非对称 signed-ratio 窗口不可直接沿用同一 L/U</strong>：其正优势有效上界为 U，负优势原始 ratio 下界为 1/U；verl 对应 exp(b)/exp(−a)。若 a≠b，直接套同一 signed window 会不匹配，需要依 sign 映射。例 a=.1,b=.4,A=−1,z=−.3：Eq.4 loss=.740818221，verl=.904837418。论文/作者默认是对称窗口；这只是参数映射反例，未证明实现违背其非对称配置契约，不据此报 bug。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>log-ratio z 是采样 token 的对数概率差，<strong>不是分布 KL</strong>。上述阈值不应写成“KL ±ε nats”的硬界；与 GSPO 序列几何均值之后裁剪也不是普遍等价。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">验证与边界</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">python3 experiments/scripts/verify_gmpo_clip_semantics.py /path/to/verl-8250\n</code></pre>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/ee80783414e46bd05f1fae83f70250c4615d99ea/experiments/scripts/verify_gmpo_clip_semantics.py\">脚本</a>仅 NumPy 模型与有限差分，对输入源码做 AST 形状检查并打印 SHA256，<strong>未执行原始 torch 函数/autograd</strong>。Python 3.9.6 与 3.12.13、NumPy 2.0.2 均通过：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>36 组长度1/2/7/16、epsilon .0003/.2/.4、优势−2/0/1.5，含部分有限 padding，比较完整 Eq.4/Algorithm 1/verl 理想目标值、有限差分及独立分支解析导数；避开裁剪拐点。</li>\n<li>原始 ratio 非对称窗口的正负优势值/梯度对照；signed-window 不匹配及旧 clamp-only 漏项反例。</li>\n<li>有限 padding 不影响有效值；混合 token 优势不能用其均值替代论文恒定序列优势；空响应和外层平均分母控制。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>verl 原代码两处 N+1e−8 稳定项使其与理想 N 分母<strong>并非逐位严格相等</strong>；上述样本最大值差约1.3650e−7，不能把这一观测当普适误差上界。源码哈希 <code>a54b6d812db4441e8b0989ae69d2c46b0a0a7b584296f73d8316f264462c37cb</code>。未覆盖非有限输入、任意 token 优势、rollout IS 权重、真实训练/优化器、分布式归一或模型参数梯度。</p>\n<p>外层 <code>torch.mean(pg_losses)</code> 是响应行均值，空响应产生0但仍计入分母。局部均值直接累加不自动等于全局均值；脚本仅演示该算术事实。<strong>不能由此认证 #7913 的完整修复</strong>：还需核对真实 actor/engine 的 microbatch 缩放、DP 归约、全局分母和空响应政策。旧“任意切分修复后即论文目标”的无条件表述撤回，本轮未改 #7913 patch、未运行旧 split 脚本，也未改变上游竞争状态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"_4\">方法教训与接续</h2>\n<p>原脚本多数判断只打印 allclose，未 assert；即使输出通过，也仅覆盖了 clamp，不是完整符号目标。新的回归检查必须包含最终标量损失、正负优势、有效掩码和外层分母，并明确数值稳定项与真实框架边界。#7913调用链已在下一轮完成限定复核：旧DP段误把loss当梯度，不能作真实DP修复证明；#7916同样使用agg_loss，停止重复候选。详见<a href=\"https://github.com/Jackie2049/perpetual-learning/blob/ee80783414e46bd05f1fae83f70250c4615d99ea/open-source/verl/candidate-7913-gmpo-geo-mean.md\">更正记录</a>，仍未运行native训练，不承接GPU或AReaL工作。</p>"}